{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53199","headline":"诗偈 二十四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 二十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"知余转般若，见余转金刚，合掌恭敬了，不动见空王。\n亦胜身命施，亦胜坐天堂，亦胜五台供，亦胜求西方。\n於住而无住，其福不可量。\n有爲如梦幻，无相契真常。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}